  "details": "laggy ik \ndesktop does not display correctly where the player is looking.\navatars randomly disapear and need to be reloaded.\nworlds are randomly sent back to community labs, even after being public for a decent amount of time.\nfeet do not stay planted on the ground\nmy fucking neck broke\ncrouching scuffed\nmore than half of the triggers included in the vrcsdk do not work or do not work as intended\nFinal ik broke\nparticle pens do not work because of the IK\ncannot hear players intermittently \nModeration warning does not work at all\nModeration Kick does not work at all.\nVote Kicking does not work at all.\nobject sync is unstable\nconsistently get messages about not being able to load worlds or unable to enter the game due to connection timeout.\nfavoriting avatars and worlds works about 10% of the time.\nfriends list does not update.\nrandomly dropped connections from worlds.\navatar reverting to old versions after updating requiring a re-upload or restart\nvrc Sync Video only works with shortened youtube links\nHold to grab\nBroken object physics after manipulating them",
